    !> calling ``rocblas_set_pointer_mode``:
    !>
    !> - If the pointer mode is set to ``rocblas_pointer_mode_host``, then this function blocks the
    !> CPU until the GPU has finished and the results are available in host memory.
    !> - If the pointer mode is set to ``rocblas_pointer_mode_device``, then this function returns
    !> immediately and synchronization is required to read the results.
    !>
    !> @param[in]
    !> handle  [rocblas_handle]
