    !> triangular part of each A_i will not be referenced.
    !>
    !> if uplo == rocblas_fill_lower:
    !> The lower triangular part of each A_i must contain
    !> the lower triangular part of a Hermitian matrix. The upper
    !> triangular part of each A_i will not be referenced.
