  interface rocblas_strtri
    !---------------------------------------------
    ! rocblas_strtri
    !---------------------------------------------
    !> \brief  BLAS Level 3 API
    !>
    !> \details
    !> The trtri functions compute the inverse of a matrix ``A``, namely, invA,
